    <summary>A cross-platform Nintendo 64 emulator with netplay, upscaling and RetroAchievements.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Gopher64 is a cross-platform Nintendo 64 emulator.

## Features
* Netplay (P2P online play)
* Homebrew support
* Upscaling
* CRT shader
* Emulated CPU overclocking
* Cheats
* Savestates
* RetroAchievements

## Package notes
* Installs the official signed standalone executable for your architecture (x64 or ARM64) and adds a `gopher64` command plus a Start Menu shortcut.
* Settings, saves and savestates are kept in your user profile, so they survive upgrades and uninstalls.
* To pass a ROM from the command line: `gopher64 "C:\path\to\rom.z64"`

See the [wiki](https://github.com/gopher64/gopher64/wiki) for default keyboard/gamepad mappings and the netplay guide.
]]></description>
